{"labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": ""}, {"text": "", "id": 2, "time": "37000", "image": ""}, {"text": "", "id": 3, "time": "76000", "image": ""}], "audiosrc": "engenn10le16ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": ""}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "I don't know whether or not you have considered how learning has changed in the digital age. Do you know whether people in your extended family had access to a computer when they were young? <br>When I was confronted with moving into the digital age in the '90s I dove in headfirst. \u201cFinally someone is going to keep all of my files for me! I'm not going to be up to my ears in papers I don't need. I'm inputting every old sheet I have in there, starting tomorrow! I'll be moving into the paperless future.\u201d Of course I was a little naive. Many people still didn't know whether this new technology would even survive to 2001. Ask someone to tell you that story!", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": ""}, {"text": "Now, children are learning to type before they can speak. They are always going to be plugged into the magic screen whether you want them to be or not. When the latest model phone comes out they want it delivered to their hands.</br>In the world of education - especially higher education - the digital world has its perks. Students are going to find there is improved access to school and course information. Inquiries are faster. The application process is more streamlined.  Students are choosing their courses in the summer, long before they arrive on campus in the fall. Some students will be participating in distance and online learning courses.", "id": 2, "time": "41000", "image": ""}, {"text": "Does it matter if these courses are at home or abroad? It does not. I myself am picking courses at uni in Australia in the coming year. <br>Assignments and feedback are given out over the net whether you take a course online or in classrooms. The world of education travels the information highway these days. Do you?", "id": 3, "time": "83000", "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn10le16ob10re2vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "_data": [], "type": "video", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about technology and personal dilemmas.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express future actions. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about unlikely situations using <span class=\"italic\">if</span> or <span class=\"italic\">whether</span>.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What types of classes do you think would be good to take on the Internet?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What types of classes are better in a traditional classroom setting?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " I'm taking a distance class on the Internet!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 